  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WPS CAAC Engagement Events and Expertise</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding of Engagement, Events and Expertise &#x2013; to support high level WPS engagement through visits which will amplify the voices of WROs, women human rights defenders and peacebuilders, and survivors of CRSV; events to galvanise international action and share best practice on WPS/CAAC; and the deployment of expertise to support engagement on WPS/CAAC with international partners.</narrative>
  </description>
